# HudFix: pause dimming at widescreen (PauseMenu2 'mask'), dolpic/0. Env: SUNSHINE_DEV_START=dolpic/0 SUNSHINE_DEV_SKIP_MOVIES=1
# SUNSHINE_DEV_SEED=1 SUNSHINE_RENDER_SCALE=1. Evidence: u.png (unpaused) and p.png (paused, mask fully faded in): the brightness
# ratio p/u is the same in the side columns as in the centre.
waitfor director mario dirstate=4 camDemo=0 timeout=3000
wait frames=240
log
shot u.png
hold START frames=3
wait frames=120
log
shot p.png
wait frames=30
end
